{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["唯願我的頭是水泉，",{"text":"眼是淚泉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好為我被殺的同胞晝夜哭泣；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯願我在曠野有棲身之處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以便遠離我的同胞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們是一群不忠不貞之徒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「他們鼓舌如簧，射出謊言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遍地充滿詭詐，毫無誠實；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們行惡不斷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不認我是上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要提防鄰居，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要信賴弟兄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為弟兄都詭計多端，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鄰居個個滿口是非。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們彼此欺騙，不說真話；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說謊成性，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不知疲倦地肆意犯罪；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們充滿暴力和詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不肯認識我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"因此，萬軍之耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，我要熬煉、試驗我這些罪惡的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除此之外，我還有什麼選擇？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們舌如毒箭，說話詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對鄰居口蜜腹劍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道我不該懲罰他們嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道我不該報應這樣的民族嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"我要為眾山痛哭哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為曠野的草場唱哀歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為那裡一片荒涼，杳無人跡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽不見牲畜的叫聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"飛鳥和走獸也逃去無蹤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「我要使耶路撒冷淪為廢墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為豺狼出沒之地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使猶大的城邑荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不見人煙。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["誰有智慧明白這事呢？誰曾受過耶和華的指教可以講解這事呢？為什麼這片土地被毀，變得荒涼、杳無人跡？"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["耶和華說：「這是因為他們棄絕我賜給他們的律法，不聽從我的話，不遵守我的律法，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["執迷不悟，隨從他們祖先的教導去供奉巴力。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["因此，以色列的上帝——萬軍之耶和華說：「看啊，我要使這百姓吃苦艾，喝毒水；"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["我要把他們分散到他們及其祖先都不認識的列國；我要使敵人揮刀追殺他們，直到滅絕他們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"萬軍之耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們聽好了，把陪哭的婦人請來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把最會哭的婦人帶來，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫她們速來為我的子民哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭得他們淚盈滿眶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭得他們淚如泉湧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為從錫安傳出哀鳴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我們竟然滅亡了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們受了奇恥大辱！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的家園被毀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們只好背井離鄉。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"婦人啊，你們要聽耶和華的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"接受祂口中的教誨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要教導女兒哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"教導鄰居唱輓歌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為死亡從窗戶爬進我們的城堡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞滅街上的孩童和廣場上的青年。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要宣告耶和華的話：「人們必屍橫遍野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像散佈在田野上的糞便，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像收割者身後沒有收集的禾捆。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["耶和華說：「智者不要誇耀自己的智慧，勇士不要誇耀自己的力量，富人不要誇耀自己的財富。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["若有人誇耀，就讓他誇耀自己認識我是耶和華，知道我喜歡在地上憑慈愛、公平和正義行事。這是耶和華說的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["耶和華說：「看啊，時候將到，我要懲罰所有只在身體上受過割禮的人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["就是埃及人、猶大人、以東人、亞捫人、摩押人和所有住在曠野、剃了鬢髮的人，因為這些人都沒有受過真正的割禮，以色列全家也沒有受過內心的割禮。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}